---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import MobileCollapsibleSection from "../components/MobileCollapsibleSection.astro";
import MobileCollapsibleEnhancer from "../components/MobileCollapsibleEnhancer.astro";

const planningPoints = [
  "Mumbai travelers often plan Alibaug as a one or two night break, so arrival time, parking, food, and beach access matter more than a long list of luxury claims.",
  "Pune travelers usually spend longer on the road, which makes a calm check-in, clear room choice, and predictable meals especially useful.",
  "Families should compare the beach area first, then choose a stay that makes the daily routine simple for children and older guests."
];
---

<Layout
  title="Alibaug Resort Guide for Mumbai and Pune Trips | Dolphin House"
  description="A practical guide to choosing where to stay in Alibaug, including travel from Mumbai and Pune, beach areas, room planning, and family-friendly resort features."
  image="/uploader/hotel-front-1.webp"
  canonical="https://dolphinhouse-alibaug.com/resort-in-alibaug"
  ogType="article"
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-950 via-teal-800 to-emerald-600 px-6 py-16 text-white shadow-2xl">
    <div class="relative grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/75">Alibaug Planning Guide</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-6xl">Alibaug Resort Guide for Mumbai and Pune Trips</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/90 md:text-xl">
          Use this guide to compare Alibaug stay areas, travel time, and practical resort facilities before choosing dates. It is written for guests who want a relaxed coastal base, not a generic list of places.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/rooms" class="btn-light">View Rooms</a>
          <a href="/booking" class="rounded-full border border-white/60 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white hover:text-sky-900">Check Availability</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/20 bg-white/10">
        <img src="/uploader/hotel-front-1.webp" alt="Dolphin House resort building in Nagaon Alibaug" class="h-full w-full object-cover" width="960" height="640" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="Choosing the Right Area" class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">Choosing the Right Area</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          Alibaug works best when you pick the area around the kind of trip you want. Staying closer to Alibaug town is useful for markets, restaurants, and quick errands. Staying near a beach village such as Nagaon is better when the main plan is shoreline time, water activities, and a quieter evening routine.
        </p>
        <p>
          For many guests, the biggest difference is not the room itself but the number of small decisions the location removes. A walkable beach, parking inside the property, and food nearby can make a short trip feel much smoother. Dolphin House sits in Nagaon, so it is better suited to travelers who want a coastal base rather than a town-center stopover.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are still comparing stay styles, read the <a href="/beach-resort-alibaug" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">beach stay guide</a> for shore access and the <a href="/nagaon-beach-resort" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">Nagaon guide</a> for local beach activity details.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="Travel from Mumbai and Pune" class="section rounded-3xl border border-sky-100 bg-white shadow-sm">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">Travel from Mumbai and Pune</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          From Mumbai, Alibaug is commonly planned as a weekend drive or ferry-plus-road journey through Mandwa. Travel time changes sharply with ferry timing, road traffic, and holiday weekends, so guests should leave buffer time for check-in and meals. From Pune, the route is longer, and an early start usually makes the first day more useful.
        </p>
        <p>
          Nagaon is around 8 km from Alibaug town and is a practical base when you want to spend more time near the coast after arrival. It lets you keep beach visits casual instead of turning every outing into a drive. That matters for families because children can rest between beach time, pool time, and meals.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        {planningPoints.map((point) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-100 bg-cyan-50 p-5">
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-cyan-950">{point}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleSection title="Where Dolphin House Fits" class="section">
    <div class="container max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="heading text-left">Where Dolphin House Fits</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
        <p>
          Dolphin House is a sensible choice when you want an Alibaug trip that is easy to manage: rooms for couples and families, an indoor pool, in-house food, parking, Wi-Fi, and a location close to Nagaon Beach. It is not trying to be a large destination resort; its strength is convenience and a homely coastal rhythm.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before booking, compare room sizes, occupancy, and AC options on the <a href="/rooms" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">rooms page</a>. For guests who expect to spend long hours in the water, the <a href="/resort-with-swimming-pool-alibaug" class="font-semibold text-sky-600 hover:underline">pool guide</a> explains how the indoor pool changes the stay experience during hot afternoons or crowded beach hours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </MobileCollapsibleSection>

  <MobileCollapsibleEnhancer />
</Layout>
